			"notes": "Disclaimer: This release of Neodymium contains several improvements that have been long in the making, most of which were finally brought over the finish line with the assistance of AI.\n\n### Changelog:\n- Added an LOD system powered by Neodymium's rendering approach\n- Added an ingame config menu\n- Fixed some performance and stutter issues\n- Fixed 1.6's vanilla Far render distance being shorter than intended (now 13 chunks)\n- Some small BTW CE 3.1.1 compatibility improvements\n\nThis release is an open test to find further bugs and issues. For the latest stable version without any AI-assisted features please use [Neodymium 0.3.2](https://github.com/BTW-Community/Neodymium/releases/tag/v0.3.2%2BBTW3.0.0)."
